An original game for CHGame inspired by the classic arcade genre of territory-claiming games. All code, art
and music are original.

Built on CHGame, Copyright 2026 Kevin Bates (bateske), Apache-2.0: the framework is vendored in chgame/ (see chgame/NOTICE and chgame/LICENSE).

The stage pictures, screens, sprites and animations (tools/paint/) were painted by the repository's own scripts with Claude as the artist;
they are original and covered by the MIT licence above. The game reads them from CHIX.DAT on the SD card (tools/make_card.py).

The sound output's timer and pin setup (CHix/Synth.cpp) follows chgame-soundtracks (https://github.com/ESPboy-edu/ESPboy_CHCore/tree/main/LIBS/chgame-soundtracks), BSD 3-Clause;
CHeleste's software mixer (Games/CHeleste/Cheleste in the same repository) showed the approach was practical (no code taken):
the copyright notices and licence text are in ../THIRD-PARTY.md.
